Conflicts: surfraw
Description: WildlifeSystems sensor control
 sr, the standard way to read sensors on a WildlifeSystems node: it runs every
 installed sensor driver, adds the node identity to each reading and returns
 one JSON array. Includes sensor-onboard, the driver for the Raspberry Pi's
 own CPU and GPU temperatures and its storage and memory use, and
 sc-prototype, the reading template every driver fills in.
 .
 The GPU temperature needs vcgencmd, from raspi-utils; without it the reading
 is reported as failed rather than omitted.
